<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all three credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.001  bln pesos 11 days  29.88  29.82   29.84    5    3</p>
<p>1.001  bln pesos  8 days  29.85  29.82   29.83    5    3</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  1 day   30.00  29.88   29.91    3    3</p>
<p>NOTE: The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
